<title>POLAND: Polish metal firm Impexmetal IPO oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Polish metal firm Impexmetal IPO oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:	     metals trader Impexmetal SA</p>
<p> Type of Issue:    new common shares</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Offered:     3,189,171</p>
<p>Total No of Shares Subscribed:  3,550,756</p>
<p> Price (PLN)	 36</p>
<p>TRANCHES	 NO OF SHARES   NO OF SHARES     ORDERS</p>
<p>		   SUBSCRIBED     ALLOTTED	   REDUCTION (PCT)</p>
<p>Institutional  3,030,705	 2,669,120	 25.18*</p>
<p>Employees	  520,051	   520,051	 --</p>
<p>* Investors who did not underwrite issue. Investment bank Nomura International Plc underwrote 1,594,586 shares.</p>
<p>NOTE - State treasury is also offering 2,976,560 shares at a minimum price of 36 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
